      "note": "Medicines with a known blood pressure lowering effect. The published examples are alpha-blockers, beta-blockers, nitrates, SGLT2 inhibitors, levodopa and antipsychotics. This draft also lists the usual blood pressure medicines (ACE inhibitors, angiotensin receptor blockers, listed systemic calcium channel blockers, and diuretics) because they clearly lower blood pressure. Only systemic diltiazem counts. Tamsulosin is included as an alpha-blocker. Count each qualifying ingredient in a combination product. Coversyl Plus is perindopril with indapamide, Twynsta is telmisartan with amlodipine, Glyxambi is empagliflozin with linagliptin and Xigduo XR is dapagliflozin with metformin. Generic packs that show the ingredient name with a company name count too. For the added oral medicines, count the qualifying ingredients only. Jardiamet supplies empagliflozin, Duodart supplies tamsulosin, and Entresto supplies valsartan. Count each of these products once. Transiderm-Nitro is a systemic glyceryl trinitrate patch."
    }
  ],
  "rule_for_models": "Suspect a finding in a person aged 65 or over when a Group A medicine and at least two distinct Group B ingredients have overlapping treatment periods or their supply dates all fall within a single 60-day interval. Count each qualifying ingredient once, including both ingredients of Twynsta or Coversyl Plus. Exclude a documented stop or switch when the medicines were not used together. If age at supply is unknown and the medicine criteria are met, report only a possible finding and ask whether the person was aged 65 or over at supply. An age below 65 rules out this finding.",
  "cannot_be_seen": "Why each medicine was prescribed, the real blood pressure, the dose really taken, and medicines bought without a prescription or supplied by a hospital or another pharmacy.",
  "ask_the_gp": "A review of the antidepressant and of the blood pressure medicines together, and a check of lying and standing blood pressure.",
  "urgency": "routine",
  "draft": true,
  "signed_by_clinical_reviewer": null
}
